    <briefdescription>
<para>A set of validation exceptions keyed by the actions they relax or assert. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Holds one or more bitmask <ref refid="structValidator_1_1Rule_1ac2209fa7790b33a3c0b8d2e331c533a7" kindref="member">Action</ref> flags and, for each flag group, the set of column names it applies to. A check passes only when the relevant flag is present in <ref refid="structValidator_1_1Rule_1ae4e62d78091b24b8d55c84d62a8988d4" kindref="member">action</ref> and a matching flag group contains the key being checked. Rules are typically static const objects in controller code, composed with the bitwise operators. <simplesect kind="note"><para>Copying/moving is implicit; the key sets own their strings. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
